docs {
  # Reversal Callback
  
  Receives transaction reversal result callbacks.
  
  ## When Called
  After a reversal request is processed (successful or failed).
  
  ## Use Cases
  - Reverse mistaken payments
  - Handle customer disputes
  - Correct wrong amounts
  
  ## ResultCodes
  - 0: Reversal successful
  - Other codes indicate why reversal failed
  
  **Note**: Called by Safaricom servers after reversal processing.
}
